rong></p>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F177822%2F177822.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】天然温泉　香梅の湯　ドーミーイン水戸（ドーミーイン・御宿野乃　ホテルズグループ） の最新空室・限定お得プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<h2 id=\"faq\" class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 my-8\">💡 茨城・大洗・筑波山・水戸・袋田の滝旅行に関するよくある質問（FAQ）</h2>\n<div class=\"space-y-4 my-6\">\n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            「五浦海岸（いづらかいがん）」と岡倉天心ゆかりの「六角堂」とは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 大小5つの浦が太平洋の荒波に削られた風光明媚な海岸で、日本美術の祖・岡倉天心が思索の場とした朱塗りの『六角堂』が波打ち際に佇みます。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            北茨城発祥「あんこうのどぶ汁」と通常のあんこう鍋の違いは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 水を一切加えず、生あんこうの身から出る水分とたっぷりのあん肝味噌だけで煮込む極めて濃厚で滋味深い漁師直伝の鍋です。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n\n        <div class=\"p-5 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200 shadow-sm space-y-2\">\n          <h4 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 bg-amber-500 text-white text-xs font-black rounded-md\">Q</span>\n            東国三社の筆頭「鹿島神宮（かしまじんぐう）」の見どころは？\n          </h4>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed pl-6 border-l-2 border-amber-200\">\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">A.</span> 紀元前660年創建と伝わる全国約600社の鹿島神宮の総本社で、奥宮や神池の御手洗池（みたらしのいけ）、地震を鎮める要石がパワースポットとして有名です。\n          </p>\n        </div>\n      \n</div>\n\n<div class=\"my-12 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-50 via-amber-50/40 to-orange-50/30 border border-amber-200/80 shadow-md\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4 border-b border-amber-200 pb-3\">\n    <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-600 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">関連記事ナビ</span>\n    <h3 class=\"text-base md:text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">🗺️ あわせて読みたい！茨城県＆周辺エリアの厳選宿ガイド</h3>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 my-4\">\n    <!-- 同一都道府県エリア特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-amber-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-amber-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>📍</span> 茨城県のエリア別・後悔回避宿特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/ibaraki-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】茨城おすすめ温泉旅館・ホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">茨城県全域（大洗ひたちなか海浜公園・筑波山つくば土浦・水戸偕楽園袋田の滝・北茨城五浦海岸鹿島）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/mito-kairakuen-fukuroda-falls-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】水戸・袋田の滝おすすめ宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">水戸市・久慈郡大子町（水戸駅前・偕楽園・千波湖・袋田の滝・奥久慈温泉郷）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/oarai-hitachinaka-seaside-park-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】大洗・ひたちなかおすすめ宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">東茨城郡大洗町・ひたちなか市（大洗海岸・大洗港・阿字ヶ浦・勝田駅前・国営ひたち海浜公園）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/tsukuba-mountain-tsukuba-city-tsuchiura-hotels-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-amber-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-amber-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-amber-700 transition line-clamp-1\">👉 【2026年最新】筑波山・つくばおすすめ宿10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">つくば市・土浦市（筑波山山麓・筑波山神社・つくば駅前・研究学園・土浦駅直結・霞ヶ浦）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 近隣・隣接都道府県の人気特集 -->\n    <div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-stone-200/90 shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n      <h4 class=\"text-xs font-black text-orange-900 flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-orange-100 pb-2\">\n        <span>🚗</span> 周遊・隣接エリアのおすすめ特集\n      </h4>\n      <div class=\"space-y-2\">\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/fukushima-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【福島県】【2026年最新】福島おすすめホテル・名湯温泉旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">福島県全域（会津若松・東山芦ノ牧・猪苗代裏磐梯・いわきハワイアンズ・高湯飯坂）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/tochigi-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【栃木県】【2026年最新】栃木おすすめホテル・名湯温泉旅館10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">栃木県全域（世界遺産日光・中禅寺湖・鬼怒川温泉・那須高原・宇都宮）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/saitama-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【埼玉県】【2026年最新】埼玉おすすめ温泉旅館・ホテル10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">埼玉県全域（秩父長瀞三峯神社・小江戸川越・大宮さいたま新都心浦和・飯能名栗温泉熊谷）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n          <a href=\"/posts/chiba-hotels-selection-guide\" class=\"block group p-2.5 rounded-xl hover:bg-orange-50 transition border border-transparent hover:border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-stone-800 group-hover:text-orange-700 transition line-clamp-1\">🏨 【千葉県】【2026年最新】千葉おすすめホテル・温泉リゾート10選！</p>\n            <p class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-500 line-clamp-1\">千葉県全域（舞浜浦安TDR・南房総館山鴨川・銚子九十九里・木更津鋸山）</p>\n          </a>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center border-t border-amber-200/60 mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3\">\n    <a href=\"/prefectures/features\" class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-700 hover:text-amber-900 underline\">\n      🎌 全47都道府県の厳選特集一覧を見る →\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n"
}